<title>HONG KONG: Silver Eagle H1 net loss HK$19.85 mln.</title>
<headline>Silver Eagle H1 net loss HK$19.85 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   29.0 loss  vs 29.0 loss (see note)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    19.85 loss vs 13.35 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     87.81	vs 86.92</p>
<p>    Company name		 Silver Eagle Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Silver Eagle manufactures and retails footwear.</p>
<p>The loss per share is based on the weighted average of 69.75 million shares vs 46.50 million. Comparative loss per share has not been adjusted for the one-for-two rights issue in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
